<h2>Charts</h2>

<p>
  A <c><chart></c> tag turns a few CSV lines into a chart in the slide's colors: <c>type=bar</c> (default), <c>line</c> or <c>pie</c>.
</p>

<chart type=bar title="Build time (s)" width=85%>
  tool, cold, warm
  webpack, 12, 4
  vite, 3, 1.2
  esbuild, 1.5, 0.6
</chart>

<notes>
  The first row names the series; with one series the bars carry their value. Charts are plain SVG, so they print and export like the rest. Reveal them with a `<step>`.
</notes>
